Internal Users (Support Staff, IT Admins):
WayFinder Agent enables internal staff to perform common user management tasks efficiently, reducing reliance on manual interventions and IT helpdesk tickets. Specifically, internal users can:

Unlock locked user accounts directly through the agent.

Deactivate or suspend user access as needed.

Update or change user roles and permissions promptly.

Customer-Facing Users (External Clients):
For external clients accessing Waystar’s systems, WayFinder Agent simplifies user account issues by providing instant self-service support options, enhancing customer satisfaction. External users can:

Easily reset their forgotten or expired passwords through guided prompts.

Request new access or additional permissions without direct support team involvement.

Seamlessly escalate more complex access issues to a live support representative via automated case creation.
